OL,3,GNEWSAPupils report bullying and abuse
OL,4,Aon journeys to school
OL,5,
OL,6,FPupils at a Kent school have said they
OL,7,Fdo not want to make bus journeys to and
OL,8,Ffrom school alone, due to bullying and
OL,9,Fanti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FMore than 200 students at Tunbridge
OL,12,FWells Girls' Grammar reported behaviour
OL,13,Fthat made them feel unsafe on their
OL,14,Fjourneys, with many reports relating to
OL,15,Fsexist or misogynistic behaviour,
OL,16,Faccording to a school survey.
OL,18,FYear 8 students Nuala and Thalia told
OL,19,FBBC Politics South East that bus
OL,20,Fjourneys made them feel anxious and
OL,21,Fscared.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
