OL,3,GNEWSAPupils report bullying and abuse
OL,4,Aon journeys to school
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus companies Arriva and Stagecoach
OL,7,Fsaid the safety of passengers was a
OL,8,Fpriority and that they worked closely
OL,9,Fwith schools and police to act when
OL,10,Fincidents occured.
